  "title": "Yabloko, Russian Antiwar Party, Is Banned From Parliament Elections",
  "summary": "A Russian parliamentary election ban bars the anti-war party Yabloko from participating in upcoming elections, with the ruling party accusing the Yabloko group of receiving undeclared campaign support. The party faces growing political pressure from the Kremlin.",
